<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Digital Twin Farmer — Blockchain-Verified Agricultural Identity & Smart Contract Financing</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,300;9..144,500;9..144,600;9..144,700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/Chart.js/4.4.0/chart.umd.min.js"></script>
<style>
  :root{
    --soil:#A8481C;
    --canopy:#141F0F;
    --canopy-2:#1D2C15;
    --parchment:#F1EAD8;
    --parchment-2:#E9E0C9;
    --ink:#20190F;
    --ink-soft:rgba(32,25,15,.66);
    --twin:#1F9E8C;
    --twin-dim:rgba(31,158,140,.14);
    --gold:#D4A63A;
    --line:rgba(32,25,15,.14);
    --line-dark:rgba(241,234,216,.14);
    --white:#fff;
    --danger:#DC3545;
    --success:#28A745;
    --warning:#FFC107;
    --info:#17A2B8;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    margin:0;
    background:var(--parchment);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  h1,h2,h3,.display{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:0;}
  .mono{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;}
  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;}
  .wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px;}
  @media(max-width:640px){.wrap{padding:0 20px;}}

  /* NAV */
  nav{
    position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;
    background:rgba(241,234,216,.92);
    backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .nav-inner{
    max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:16px 32px;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;
  }
  .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-weight:600;font-size:15px;}
  .brand-mark{
    width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:4px;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--soil) 50%,var(--twin) 50%);
    flex:none;
  }
  .nav-links{display:flex;gap:28px;font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-soft);}
  .nav-links a{position:relative;padding-bottom:4px;}
  .nav-links a:hover{color:var(--ink);}
  .nav-links a::after{
    content:"";position:absolute;left:0;right:100%;bottom:-1px;height:2px;
    background:var(--twin);transition:right .25s ease;
  }
  .nav-links a:hover::after{right:0;}
  @media(max-width:860px){.nav-links{display:none;}}
  .nav-cta{
    font-size:13px;font-weight:600;padding:9px 16px;border-radius:2px;
    background:var(--ink);color:var(--parchment);white-space:nowrap;
  }

  /* HERO */
  header.hero{
    background:radial-gradient(1200px 500px at 15% -10%,var(--canopy-2),var(--canopy) 60%);
    color:var(--parchment);
    padding:88px 0 0;
    overflow:hidden;
    position:relative;
  }
  .eyebrow{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--twin);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:22px;
  }
  .eyebrow::before{content:"";width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--twin);box-shadow:0 0 0 4px var(--twin-dim);}
  .hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:56px;align-items:center;}
  @media(max-width:960px){.hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
  .hero h1{font-size:clamp(34px,4.6vw,58px);line-height:1.04;font-weight:600;}
  .hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--twin);}
  .hero p.lead{margin-top:22px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;max-width:46ch;color:rgba(241,234,216,.78);}
  .hero-ctas{display:flex;gap:14px;margin-top:32px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .btn{
    font-size:14px;font-weight:600;padding:13px 22px;border-radius:2px;
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;cursor:pointer;border:1px solid transparent;
  }
  .btn-primary{background:var(--twin);color:#08211d;}
  .btn-primary:hover{background:#28b6a2;}
  .btn-ghost{border-color:rgba(241,234,216,.3);color:var(--parchment);background:transparent;}
  .btn-ghost:hover{border-color:rgba(241,234,216,.6);}

  /* TWIN CARD */
  .twin-wrap{
    background:linear-gradient(145deg,#0d1a17,#1a2d26);
    border-radius:16px;
    padding:28px 24px;
    border:1px solid rgba(31,158,140,.3);
    box-shadow:0 12px 48px rgba(0,0,0,.5);
    position:relative;
    overflow:hidden;
    max-width:440px;
    margin:0 auto;
  }
  .twin-wrap::before{
    content:"";position:absolute;top:-60px;right:-60px;width:220px;height:220px;
    border-radius:50%;background:rgba(31,158,140,.06);
  }
  .twin-wrap::after{
    content:"";position:absolute;bottom:-90px;left:-90px;width:280px;height:280px;
    border-radius:50%;background:rgba(168,72,28,.06);
  }
  .twin-header{
    display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;
    border-bottom:1px solid rgba(31,158,140,.2);padding-bottom:12px;margin-bottom:16px;
    position:relative;z-index:1;
  }
  .twin-label{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em;
    color:var(--twin);text-transform:uppercase;
  }
  .sbt-badge{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;
    color:rgba(241,234,216,.5);background:rgba(31,158,140,.15);
    padding:3px 12px;border-radius:12px;letter-spacing:.05em;
  }
  .twin-avatar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:16px;position:relative;z-index:1;}
  .avatar-circle{
    width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2b3a1f,#1a2712);
    border:2px solid rgba(31,158,140,.4);
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;
  }
  .twin-name{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;color:var(--parchment);}
  .twin-id{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:rgba(241,234,216,.4);margin-top:2px;}
  .twin-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px 20px;margin-bottom:16px;position:relative;z-index:1;}
  .twin-field span{display:block;color:rgba(241,234,216,.4);font-size:10px;margin-bottom:2px;}
  .twin-field b{color:var(--parchment);font-weight:500;font-size:13px;}
  .twin-field .twin-accent{color:var(--twin);font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-weight:600;}
  .score-box{
    background:rgba(31,158,140,.08);border-radius:8px;padding:12px 16px;
    margin-bottom:12px;position:relative;z-index:1;
  }
  .score-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;}
  .score-label{font-size:12px;color:rgba(241,234,216,.5);}
  .score-value{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:var(--twin);}
  .score-bar{width:100%;height:6px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border-radius:3px;margin-top:6px;overflow:hidden;}
  .score-fill{height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--twin),#28b6a2);border-radius:3px;}
  .verify-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--twin);position:relative;z-index:1;}

  /* SECTION HEADS */
  section{padding:80px 0;}
  .section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:44px;}
  .section-head .kicker{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--twin);margin-bottom:10px;display:block;}
  .section-head h2{font-size:clamp(26px,3vw,38px);font-weight:600;max-width:22ch;}
  .section-head p{max-width:38ch;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;}

  /* PROBLEM */
  .problem-sec{background:var(--canopy);color:var(--parchment);}
  .problem-sec .section-head p{color:rgba(241,234,216,.66);}
  .ledger{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);border-top:1px solid var(--line-dark);}
  .ledger .row{padding:28px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-dark);border-right:1px solid var(--line-dark);padding-right:24px;}
  .ledger .row:last-child{border-right:none;}
  @media(max-width:760px){.ledger{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.ledger .row{border-right:none;}}
  .ledger .num{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:48px;font-weight:600;color:var(--twin);}
  .ledger .label{font-size:14px;color:rgba(241,234,216,.62);margin-top:8px;line-height:1.55;max-width:34ch;}
  .ledger .src{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;color:rgba(241,234,216,.35);margin-top:10px;}

  /* LAYERS */
  .layer-stack{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;}
  @media(max-width:860px){.layer-stack{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
  .layer-card{
    border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:28px 24px;background:var(--white);
    cursor:pointer;transition:all .3s ease;position:relative;
  }
  .layer-card:hover,.layer-card.active{
    transform:translateY(-6px);
    box-shadow:0 20px 40px -20px rgba(32,25,15,.4);
    border-color:var(--twin);
  }
  .layer-card .idx{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--soil);letter-spacing:.08em;}
  .layer-card h3{font-size:22px;margin-top:14px;font-weight:600;}
  .layer-card .stack-name{font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:12px;line-height:1.6;}
  .layer-card .detail{
    max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .4s ease,margin-top .4s ease;
    font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);line-height:1.7;
  }
  .layer-card.active .detail{max-height:300px;margin-top:16px;}
  .chip{
    display:inline-block;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;
    background:var(--twin-dim);color:#0e6d5f;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:3px;margin:4px 6px 0 0;
  }

  /* TOKEN SECTION */
  .token-sec{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--parchment-2),var(--parchment));}
  .token-display{
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0a1613,#12211d);
    border-radius:16px;padding:36px;
    border:1px solid rgba(31,158,140,.4);
    box-shadow:0 20px 60px -20px rgba(0,0,0,.6);
    max-width:520px;margin:0 auto;color:var(--parchment);
    position:relative;overflow:hidden;
  }
  .token-display::before{
    content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;
    background:repeating-linear-gradient(115deg,rgba(31,158,140,.04) 0 2px,transparent 2px 30px);
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  .token-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;margin-bottom:24px;position:relative;z-index:1;}
  .token-title{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:600;}
  .token-sub{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--twin);letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px;}
  .token-chain{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;
    background:rgba(31,158,140,.18);color:var(--twin);padding:4px 12px;border-radius:12px;
  }
  .token-hash{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;
    color:rgba(241,234,216,.45);word-break:break-all;
    background:rgba(0,0,0,.3);padding:10px 14px;border-radius:6px;
    margin:16px 0;position:relative;z-index:1;
  }
  .token-attrs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;position:relative;z-index:1;}
  .token-attr span{display:block;color:rgba(241,234,216,.4);font-size:10.5px;margin-bottom:3px;}
  .token-attr b{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-weight:500;font-size:13px;}
  .token-footer{
    margin-top:24px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid rgba(31,158,140,.15);
    display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;color:rgba(241,234,216,.35);
    position:relative;z-index:1;
  }

  /* DEMO DASHBOARD */
  .demo-sec{background:var(--parchment-2);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);}
  .demo-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:22px;}
  @media(max-width:960px){.demo-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
  .card{background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:24px;}
  .card h4{font-size:11.5px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--ink-soft);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:16px;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;}
  .farmer-tabs{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:28px;}
  .farmer-tab{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:13px;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:3px;
    border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--white);cursor:pointer;color:var(--ink-soft);
    transition:all .2s ease;
  }
  .farmer-tab.active{background:var(--ink);color:var(--parchment);border-color:var(--ink);}
  .metric-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:16px;}
  .metric{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:4px;padding:12px 14px;}
  .metric .v{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:18px;font-weight:600;}
  .metric .l{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:3px;}
  .chart-box{height:220px;margin-top:8px;}

  /* CONTRACT SIMULATOR */
  .contract-steps{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:16px;}
  .step-btn{
    font-size:13px;font-weight:600;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid var(--ink);
    background:transparent;color:var(--ink);cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s ease;
  }
  .step-btn:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:not-allowed;}
  .step-btn:not(:disabled):hover{background:var(--ink);color:var(--parchment);}
  .ledger-feed{
    background:#0d1a17;border-radius:6px;padding:16px 18px;height:200px;overflow-y:auto;
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;color:#a9d8cc;line-height:2;
  }
  .ledger-feed .ln{opacity:0;animation:fadein .3s ease forwards;}
  @keyframes fadein{to{opacity:1;}}
  .ledger-feed .tag{color:var(--twin);}
  .ledger-feed .amt{color:var(--gold);}

  /* WORKFLOW */
  .flow-sec{background:var(--canopy);color:var(--parchment);padding:80px 0;}
  .flow-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:20px;}
  @media(max-width:900px){.flow-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);}}
  @media(max-width:600px){.flow-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}}
  .flow-step{
    text-align:center;padding:20px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line-dark);
    border-radius:6px;background:rgba(31,158,140,.04);position:relative;
  }
  .flow-step .num{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--twin);
    width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid var(--twin);
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 12px;
  }
  .flow-step .lbl{font-size:12.5px;color:rgba(241,234,216,.75);line-height:1.4;}

  /* ROADMAP */
  .phase-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:140px 1fr;gap:28px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:32px 0;}
  .phase-row:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);}
  .phase-num{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;color:var(--soil);font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;}
  .phase-months{display:block;font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:6px;}
  .phase-body h3{font-size:20px;font-weight:600;}
  .phase-body ul{margin:14px 0 0;padding-left:18px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;}

  /* IMPACT */
  .impact-sec{background:var(--canopy);color:var(--parchment);}
  .impact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px;margin-top:20px;}
  @media(max-width:760px){.impact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
  .impact-card{border:1px solid var(--line-dark);border-radius:6px;padding:26px;}
  .impact-card .n{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:36px;color:var(--twin);font-weight:600;}
  .impact-card .d{font-size:13.5px;color:rgba(241,234,216,.62);margin-top:10px;line-height:1.6;}
  .sdg-row{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:32px;}
  .sdg-chip{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11.5px;border:1px solid var(--line-dark);padding:8px 14px;border-radius:3px;color:rgba(241,234,216,.72);}

  /* FOOTER */
  footer{padding:80px 0 40px;}
  .team-names{margin-top:22px;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-soft);line-height:1.9;}
  .foot-bottom{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:48px;padding-top:28px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-soft);flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;}

  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
    *{animation-duration:.001ms !important;transition-duration:.001ms !important;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- NAV -->
<nav>
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <div class="brand"><span class="brand-mark"></span> Digital Twin Farmer</div>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#problem">Problem</a>
      <a href="#layers">How it works</a>
      <a href="#token">Blockchain ID</a>
      <a href="#demo">Live demo</a>
      <a href="#workflow">Workflow</a>
      <a href="#roadmap">Roadmap</a>
    </div>
    <a href="#demo" class="nav-cta">View Demo →</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<header class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">Blockchain-Verified Agricultural Identity · Malawi</span>
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div>
        <h1>What a farmer can <em>produce</em> matters more than what they <em>own</em>.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Digital Twin Farmer turns satellite data, soil sensors and repayment history into a verifiable, portable credit identity — so smallholders can borrow against their potential, not their title deed.</p>
        <div class="hero-ctas">
          <a href="#demo" class="btn btn-primary">View the live twin →</a>
          <a href="#problem" class="btn btn-ghost">Read the case for financing</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="twin-wrap">
        <div class="twin-header">
          <span class="twin-label">Digital Twin Identity</span>
          <span class="sbt-badge">SBT · CELO</span>
        </div>
        <div class="twin-avatar">
          <div class="avatar-circle">
            <svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none">
              <circle cx="16" cy="10" r="6" stroke="#1f9e8c" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              <path d="M4 28C4 22 9 18 16 18C23 18 28 22 28 28" stroke="#1f9e8c" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="twin-name">Farmer Identity</div>
            <div class="twin-id">DTF-000001</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="twin-grid">
          <div class="twin-field"><span>Country</span><b>Malawi</b></div>
          <div class="twin-field"><span>District</span><b>—</b></div>
          <div class="twin-field"><span>Enterprise</span><b>Crop / Livestock</b></div>
          <div class="twin-field"><span>Digital ID</span><b class="twin-accent">DTF-000001</b></div>
        </div>
        <div class="score-box">
          <div class="score-row">
            <span class="score-label">AI Credit Score</span>
            <span class="score-value">82%</span>
          </div>
          <div class="score-bar"><div class="score-fill" style="width:82%"></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="verify-row">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none">
            <circle cx="7" cy="7" r="6" stroke="#1f9e8c" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <path d="M4 7L6 9L10 5" stroke="#1f9e8c" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          </svg>
          <span class="mono" style="font-size:11px;">Blockchain Verified • CELO</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- PROBLEM -->
<section class="problem-sec" id="problem">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <span class="kicker">The financing gap</span>
        <h2>Malawi's farmers grow the economy. The credit system doesn't see them.</h2>
      </div>
      <p>Three barriers compound into one outcome: capital never reaches the field where it would do the most good.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ledger">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="num">70%</div>
        <div class="label">of smallholders hold no land title or physical asset a bank will accept as collateral.</div>
        <div class="src">— Reserve Bank of Malawi, 2024</div>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="num">&lt;10%</div>
        <div class="label">of agricultural credit in Malawi actually reaches smallholder farmers.</div>
        <div class="src">— Reserve Bank of Malawi, 2024</div>
      </div>
